    "https://dwu.hireclick.com/jobboard/": {
      "title": "Explore a Career with Dakota Wesleyan University",
      "description": "Explore a Career with Dakota Wesleyan University Explore a Career with Dakota Wesleyan University Explore a Career with Dakota Wesleyan University Current Openings All Categories All Locations No Job Openings Currently Available Welcome! Welcome! Come work with us. Dakota Wesleyan is a private liberal arts university with 900 students. We employ 150 faculty and staff members on a family-oriented campus with an emphasis on learning, leadership, faith and service. We’re proudly affiliated with the Dakotas Conference of the United Methodist Church, but we openly welcome members of any and all faiths as both students and employees. If this sounds like a good fit for you, we’d love to hear from you! You can view all of our open positions below, or contact our human resources office for more information. Dakota Wesleyan University is an equal opportunity employer and provider."
    },
