egin at 11 a.m. 1-3 p.m. – Classes scheduled MWF, MTWR, MTWF, WF & MW that begin at noon. 3-5 p.m. – Classes scheduled MWF, MTWR, MTWF, WF & MW that begin at 3 p.m. Evening Finals Monday-Friday, December 7-11 *7-Week, Online, Rapid City and Sioux Falls Campus – refer to the course syllabus Spring 2027 Monday, Jan. 11 – Classes begin at 8 a.m. Friday, Jan. 15 – Last Day for Restricted-Adviser Only-Add/Drop Monday, Jan. 18 – Martin Luther King Jr. Day, No Classes, Offices Closed Friday, Jan. 22 – Last Day for Restricted-Adviser and Instructor-Add/Drop Friday, Jan. 22 – Fall Incomplete Grades Due Monday, Feb. 15 – Student Bills to be Paid in Full Friday, March 5 – Midterm Grades Due Friday, March 5 – Spring Break Begins at 10 p.m. Monday-Friday, March 8-March 12 – Spring Break Monday, March 15 – Classes Resume at 8 a.m. Monday, March 22 – Registration for Fall Semesters Begins Friday, March 26 – Good Friday, No Classes, Offices Closed Monday, March 29 – Easter Monday, No Classes, Offices Closed Thursday, April 1 – December Graduation Applications Due Friday, April 16 – Last Day for Withdraw Wednesday, April 21 – Capstone Day Monday-Friday, April 26-April 30 – Evening Final Exams Friday, April 30 – Honors Banquet Monday, May 3 – Last Day of Classes before Day Final Exams Tuesday, May 4 – DWU Service Day, No Classes Wednesday-Friday, May 5-7 – Day Final Exams Sunday, May 9 – Baccalaureate and Commencement Tuesday, May 11 – Grades Due Spring 2027 Finals Wednesday, May 5 8-10 a.m. – Classes scheduled MWF, MTWR, MTWF, WF & MW that begin at 9 a.m. 10 a.m.-noon – Classes scheduled MWF, MTWR, MTWF, WF & MW that begin at 11 a.m. 1-3 p.m. – Classes scheduled MWF, MTWR, MTWF, WF & MW that begin at 1 p.m. 3-5 p.m. – Classes scheduled MWF, MTWR, MTWF, WF & MW that begin at 2 p.m. Thursday, May 6 8-10 a.m. – Classes scheduled Tuesday and/or Thursday between 8 a.m. and 8:30 a.m. 10 a.m.-noon – Classes scheduled Tuesday and/or Thursday between 9:30 a.m. and noon. 1-3 p.m. – Classes sc