Friday, Feb. 5 – Last day for withdrawal Monday, Feb. 15 – Student Bills to be Paid in Full Friday, Feb. 26 – Session I classes end Friday, Feb. 26 – Final exam/submissions due Friday, March 1 – Final grades due Monday, March 15 – Session II classes begin Friday, March 19 – Last day for drop/add Friday, March 26 – Good Friday holiday Monday, March 29 – Easter Monday holiday Friday, April 9 – Last day for withdrawal Wednesday, April 30 – Session II classes end Wednesday, April 30 – Final exam/submissions due Tuesday, May 11 – Final grades due Summer 2027 Monday, May 10 – Session I classes begin Friday, May 14 – Last day for drop/add Monday, May 31 – Memorial Day holiday Friday, June 4 – Last day for withdrawal Wednesday, June 23 – Session I classes end Wednesday, June 23 – Final exam/submissions due Monday, June 28 – Final grades due Monday, June 28 – Session II classes begin Friday, July 2 – Last day for drop/add Monday, July 5 – Independence Day holiday Friday, July 23 – Last day for withdrawal Saturday, July 31 – Student Bills to be Paid in Full Wednesday, Aug. 11 – Session II classes end Wednesday, Aug. 11 – Final exam/submissions due Monday, Aug. 16 – Final grades due Dakota Wesleyan University academic calendars are subject to change due to forces beyond the university's control or as deemed necessary by the university in order\n        to fulfill its educational objectives. Courses that do not begin and end within the normal session time frame, status dates will be adjusted accordingly. As a student, you must attend your on-campus course by the third day or your registration will be cancelled, unless the instructor gives permission otherwise. For\n        online courses, you must log in to the course by the end of third day. Questions? Please call for assistance with the following: Registration (enrolling in a class, drop/add, withdrawal) – Call Registration at 605-995-2642 Billing – Call Billing at 605-995-2693 Financial Aid – Call Financial Aid at 605-995-26