d has nearly 400 members. Donors to the Wesleyan Scholarship Fund, TeamMakers, endowed or annual scholarships, Friends of the Performing Arts, mission trips, the McGovern Center,\n        capital projects, endowment, departments and programs all are members of President’s Circle. Recognition Levels Members of the President’s Circle receive an exclusive newsletter and member-only event\n        invitations. Legacy Circle: $25,000 and above Visionary Circle: $10,000 to $24,999 Trustees’ Circle: $5,000 to $9,999 Leadership Circle: $2,500 to $4,999 1885 Circle: $1,885 to $2,499 Wesleyan Circle: $1,000 to $1,884 Young President’s Circle: $500 (age 35 & younger) Do you wish to become a member of the President’s Circle? Give Now Quick Links Student Central Wesleyan Central Campus Map McGovern Library Academic Catalog Academic Calendar About Us COVID-19 Information Privacy Policy 1200 W. University Ave. Mitchell, SD 57301 605-995-2600 Contact Us instagram facebook twitter linkedin flickr youtube © 2026 Dakota Wesleyan University Website By morweb.org Student Central Wesleyan Central Campus Map McGovern Library Academic Catalog Academic Calendar About Us COVID-19 Information Privacy Policy Check Links Check SEO × SEO Report Placeholder issue 1: This is a test issue. Placeholder issue 2: Another test issue. Check Performance × Performance Report Placeholder issue 1: This is a test issue. Placeholder issue 2: Another test issue. Check Accessibility Quick Links Menu Student Central Wesleyan Central Campus Map McGovern Library Academic Catalog Academic Calendar About Us COVID-19 Information Privacy Policy Accessibility High Contrast Dark White text on black backgrounds (WCAG-style) High Contrast Light Black text on white backgrounds (WCAG-style) Grayscale Remove colors from page Highlight Links Make links stand out clearly Dyslexia Friendly Use easier-to-read font Text Spacing Increase line & letter spacing Reading Guide Highlight current line while reading Large Cursor Increase