ty at Coronation. Learn More 07 Oct 2026 Music Space Renovation Dedication Celebrate the newly renovated Music Department honoring donors Ken and Diane Ketel. Learn More 08 Oct 2026 Legacy Banquet Honoring donors and distinguished alumni. Registration is required. Learn More 09 Oct 2026 50th Football Reunion Celebrating 50 years since the 1976 DWU Football Conference Championship Learn More 09 Oct 2026 Alumni Happy Hour Join fellow DWU alumni for a relaxed and fun evening at Palace City Brewing Co.! Learn More 09 Oct 2026 Alumni Registration Check in and receive information about weekend events. Learn More 09 Oct 2026 Athletic Hall of Fame Banquet Honoring DWU Hall of Fame inductees. Registration is required. Learn More 09 Oct 2026 Campus Tours Take a stroll around the beautiful DWU campus. Learn More 09 Oct 2026 Don Messer Meet and Greet and Book Signing Join us for a special meet and greet and book signing with Don Messer (former DWU president) as he celebrates the launch of his new book, Making a Difference: From Prairie Roots to Global Outreach. Learn More 09 Oct 2026 Opperman Lecture Hear from distinguished alumni on their DWU experience. Learn More 09 Oct 2026 Volleyball Game Don’t miss the action! Come support DWU Volleyball as they take on Doane. 10 Oct 2026 Blue & White Days Parade Come cheer loud and proud at DWU’s Blue & White Days Parade. Fun, floats, and friends. Don’t miss out on the excitement! Learn More 10 Oct 2026 Blue & White Unite All-alumni reunion Celebrating reunion years ending in '6 and '1 with special\n50-year recognition for the class of 1976 Learn More 10 Oct 2026 Homecoming Football Game Get ready to roar! Cheer the DWU Tigers football team as they face off against Concordia. 10 Oct 2026 Parade Alumni Gathering Coffee, donuts and fellowship prior to the parade. Learn More 10 Oct 2026 Tiger Fest Enjoy family fun with food, and games. Learn More 10 Oct 2026 Volleyball Game Don’t miss the action! Come support DWU Volleyball as they take on Hastings. 11 Oct 2026 Downtown First United Methodist Worship Service 10 a.m., 310 N. Rowley St., Mitchell, SD 11 Oct 2026 Fusion Contemporary Worship Service 10 a.m., DWU Sherman Center 11 Oct 2026 Homecoming Choir and Bells Concert Join the DWU community for a performance by the Ron and Sheilah Gates Department of Music. Top Song Playlists for Reunion Years Take it back to your senior year at Dakota Wesleyan University by listening to these top song playlists. Click the links below to listen in Spotify! 1950s 1960s 1970s 1980s 1990s 2000s 2010s 2020s Questions? If you have any questions or would like further information, please contact us. Email: alumni@dwu.edu Phone: 605-995-2603 Quick Links Student Central Wesleyan Central Campus Map McGovern Library Academic Catalog Academic Calendar About Us COVID-19 Information Privacy Policy 1200 W. University Ave. Mitchell, SD 57301 605-995-2600 Contact Us instagram facebook twitter linkedin flickr youtube © 2026 Dakota Wesleyan University Website By morweb.org Student Central Wesleyan Central Campus Map McGovern Library Academic Catalog Academic Calendar About Us COVID-19 Information Privacy Policy Check Links Check SEO × SEO Report Placeholder issue 1: This is a test issue. Placeholder issue 2: Another test issue. Check Performance × Performance Report Placeholder issue 1: This is a test issue. Placeholder issue 2: Another test issue. Check Accessibility Quick Links Menu Student Central Wesleyan Central Campus Map McGovern Library Academic Catalog Academic Calendar About Us COVID-19 Information Privacy Policy Accessibility High Contrast Dark White text on black backgrounds (WCAG-style) High Contrast Light Black text on white backgrounds (WCAG-style) Grayscale Remove colors from page Highlight Links Make links stand out clearly Dyslexia Friendly Use easier-to-read font Text Spacing Increase line & letter spacing Reading Guide Highlight current line while reading Large Cursor Increase cursor size Hide Images Hide all images