he requirements for admission. For Parents & Families Scholarships & Financial Aid Tuition & Fees Visit Campus New Student Registration The First Year Experience International Students Transfer Students Request Information Meet Our Admissions Staff Please Select... For Parents & Families Scholarships & Financial Aid Tuition & Fees Visit Campus New Student Registration The First Year Experience International Students Transfer Students Request Information Meet Our Admissions Staff Life at DWU Living on campus is a great opportunity to make lifelong friends. Student Activities and Organizations We offer a variety of ways to get involved on campus. Academic & Career Services Center Graduate Studies Student Handbook Office of Disability Services Student Handbook Student Life Staff Student Services Title IX TRIO Student Support Services Please Select... Academic & Career Services Center Graduate Studies Student Handbook Office of Disability Services Student Handbook Student Life Staff Student Services Title IX TRIO Student Support Services Giving Every gift helps our students, no matter how large or small. Alumni There are many ways to stay connected to Dakota Wesleyan University. Alumni & Giving President’s Circle Blue & White Days Wesleyan Today Alumni Magazine Advancement Staff Please Select... Alumni & Giving President’s Circle Blue & White Days Wesleyan Today Alumni Magazine Advancement Staff Why DWU Why DWU DWU History Mission & Values Accreditation DWU Facts News Events Who We Are Board of Trustees President’s Office and Cabinet Leadership Council Faculty & Staff Directory Campus Map About Mitchell Consumer Information FAQs Our Services DWU Store McGovern Library For Employers Employment at DWU Hold Your Events at DWU McGovern Center for Leadership and Public Service The Kelley Center for Entrepreneurship Why DWU Why DWU DWU History Mission & Values Accreditation DWU Facts News Events Who We Are Board of Trustees President’s Office and Cabinet Leadership Council Faculty & Staff Directory Campus Map About Mitchell Consumer Information FAQs Our Services DWU Store McGovern Library For Employers Employment at DWU Hold Your Events at DWU McGovern Center for Leadership and Public Service The Kelley Center for Entrepreneurship Please Select... Please Select... Please Select... Please Select... Please Select... Please Select... Please Select... Please Select... Please Select... Please Select... Menu Close Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate & Online A.S. in Nursing (Rapid City Campus) A.S. in Nursing (Sioux Falls Campus) Degree Completion Mitchell Scholars Program Summer Courses Internships Academic Calendar Academic Catalogs Admissions For Parents & Families Scholarships & Financial Aid Tuition & Fees Visit Campus New Student Registration The First Year Experience International Students Transfer Students Request Information Meet Our Admissions Staff Student Life Academic & Career Services Center Graduate Studies Student Handbook Office of Disability Services Student Handbook Student Life Staff Student Services Title IX TRIO Student Support Services Alumni & Giving Alumni & Giving Giving Alumni President’s Circle Blue & White Days Wesleyan Today Alumni Magazine Advancement Staff About DWU Why DWU Why DWU DWU History Mission & Values Accreditation DWU Facts News Events Who We Are Board of Trustees President’s Office and Cabinet Leadership Council Faculty & Staff Directory Campus Map About Mitchell Consumer Information FAQs Our Services DWU Store McGovern Library For Employers Employment at DWU Hold Your Events at DWU McGovern Center for Leadership and Public Service The Kelley Center for Entrepreneurship Athletics Performing Arts Visit Give Apply Now instagram facebook twitter linkedin Campus Map & Directions Welcome to Tiger Territory We’re excited for you to visit our campus, located at: 1200 W. University Ave. Mitchell, SD 57301 Ways to Visit Campus 1 Rollins Campus Center 2 Sherman Center and Wagner Chapel 3 School of Business, Innovation and Leadership 4 Corrigan Health Sciences Center 5 DWU/Avera Sports and Wellness Complex 6 McGovern Library Parking Lot *Please note that Google Maps has incorrectly identified a large parking lot between McGovern Avenue and S. Duff Street as Pioneer Park. Much of this area is actually a public parking. Plug 352 W. Andrews Street into your GPS for exact directions to the Admissions visitor parking lot. For a correct, printable map, download the PDF version. Download Printable Campus Map From Interstate 90 Take E xit 332 (Burr Street). Travel north on Burr Street to Norway Street. Turn left (west). Travel west on\n        Norway Street to Duff Street and turn right (north). Travel north on Duff Street to Andrews Street and turn left (west). From U.S. Highway 37 North Follow Highway 37 Truck Route around west side of Mitchell, heading south past Havens Street to\n        Norway Street. Turn left (east) on Norway Street. Travel east on Norway Street to Duff Street and turn left (north). Travel north on Duff Street to Andrews Street and turn left\n        (west). Key Buildings Here are a few key office locations that might help when you get to campus: Admissions: Rollins Campus Center Alumni: Alumni Welcome Center (located inside the Dakota Discovery Museum) Athletics: Christen Family Athletic Center Registrar: Rollins Campus Center McGovern Library & Tiger Café with Starbucks School of Business, Innovation and Leadership DWU/Avera Sports and Wellness Complex Explore Campus Buildings Where to Park? Once you get here, you are welcome to use the parking lot at McGovern Avenue and Andrews Street. Plug 352 W. Andrews Street into your GPS for exact directions. For a full map of the DWU campus, please see our campus map. Take a tour of our campus virtually . Questions? Whether you need additional directions or are simply curious about our campus layout, we’re happy to help. Email: Admissions@dwu.edu Phone: 605-995-2600 Quick Links Student Central Wesleyan Central Campus Map McGovern Library Academic Catalog Academic Calendar About Us COVID-19 Information Privacy Policy 1200 W. University Ave. Mitchell, SD 57301 605-995-2600 Contact Us instagram facebook twitter linkedin flickr youtube © 2026 Dakota Wesleyan University Website By morweb.org Student Central Wesleyan Central Campus Map McGovern Library Academic Catalog Academic Calendar About Us COVID-19 Information Privacy Policy Check Links Check SEO × SEO Report Placeholder issue 1: This is a test issue. Placeholder issue 2: Another test issue. Check Performance × Performance Report Placeholder issue 1: This is a test issue. Placeholder issue 2: Another test issue. Check Accessibility Quick Links Menu Student Central Wesleyan Central Campus Map McGovern Library Academic Catalog Academic Calendar About Us COVID-19 Information Privacy Policy Accessibility High Contrast Dark White text on black backgrounds (WCAG-style) High Contrast Light Black text on white backgrounds (WCAG-style) Grayscale Remove colors from page Highlight Links Make links stand out clearly Dyslexia Friendly Use easier-to-read font Text Spacing Increase line & letter spacing Reading Guide Highlight current line while reading Large Cursor Increase cursor size Hide Images Hide all images on the page Core Controls Reset 100% Text Size 100% Line Height 1.5 Letter Spacing 0px Reset All"
